### Resolve ticket from IN_PROGRESS
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/6c2ad02e-c394-41fb-8e38-dfffd581a59d/resolution
Authorization: Bearer {{support_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "17"
Idempotency-Key: resolve-ticket-6c2ad02e-v17-001
X-Correlation-ID: b2a09295-5b64-4d28-8d40-ac36c7f46aec

{
  "resolutionCode": "FIXED",
  "resolutionSummary": "Reinstalled the endpoint management profile and confirmed the device checked in successfully."
}

### Invalid: requester cannot resolve a ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/6c2ad02e-c394-41fb-8e38-dfffd581a59d/resolution
Authorization: Bearer {{requester_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "17"
Idempotency-Key: resolve-ticket-6c2ad02e-v17-requester

{
  "resolutionCode": "FIXED",
  "resolutionSummary": "Requester attempts to resolve the ticket directly."
}

### Invalid: summary too short
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/6c2ad02e-c394-41fb-8e38-dfffd581a59d/resolution
Authorization: Bearer {{support_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "17"
Idempotency-Key: resolve-ticket-6c2ad02e-v17-short-summary

{
  "resolutionCode": "FIXED",
  "resolutionSummary": "Done."
}
